{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Variants","anchor":"Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion time or percentage."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": no ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Statuses","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Statuses"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"onboarding).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrieval)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Gap size","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Gap-size"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}]},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}]}]}]},{"text":"Track","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Track"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Helper-text","type":"heading","text":"Helper text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional string displayed centered below the bar. It can provide context about the process or show"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current progress value (e.g. "},{"code":"\"Uploading...\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Animation","type":"heading","text":"Animation"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":": when ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the target "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: \"Uploading…\")","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status, a small gap, a stop indicator and no animation","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3,","                                status: .warning,","                                stopIndicator: true,","                                gapSize: .small,","                                animated: false)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate (always animated — Android Material 3 two-line race)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator()","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a ","type":"text"},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is provided, it is exposed as the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Full Keyboard Access","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via "},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".isStaticText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" trait is used."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a ","type":"text"},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wireframe","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Version","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslinearprogressindicator"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A linear indicator shows the progress of a task using a horizontal line.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best used inside layouts to show progress.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documen